label story_03_complete (The Long Road Complete)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): You reached the Ruins of Veld. I can feel their stones through your breath — cold, broken, and older than anything in this meadow.
"Dianthus Core": Once, living roots crossed there without fear. Now the cracks drink shadow and give back only hunger. The stone remembers gardens, but the gardens do not remember the stone.
"Dianthus Core": Tread carefully among the broken walls. Shadow Resin gathers in the places where old life was pressed too long beneath the dark. It is not poison — but it is not kind.
"Dianthus Core": Bring back proof of what you find. I will teach the garden how to answer ruin with craft. That is what roots do — they grow through what tried to bury them.
[signal arg="quest_start:story_04_ruins"]
[end_timeline]
